sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Host
    participant UI as Party Detail UI
    participant API as Django API + session/CSRF
    participant S as decide_join_request
    participant DB as ORM / PostgreSQL
    Note over UI,DB: US10 baseline main b6d4bd0 - paths below use /api/v1 prefix
    UI->>API: GET /parties/{id}/join-requests/pending
    API->>API: University identity + Host guard
    alt Guard fails or Party not found
        API-->>UI: 401 / 403 / 404
    else Authorized Host
        API->>DB: Read Pending requests with public names
        DB-->>API: Pending rows (no seat reserved)
        API-->>UI: 200 data list
    end
    H->>UI: Approve or Reject
    UI->>UI: Disable clicked button (current behavior)
    UI->>API: POST /parties/{id}/join-requests/{request_id}/decision<br/>{status: Approved or Rejected} + session/CSRF
    alt Invalid session / identity / CSRF / payload
        API-->>UI: 401 / 403 / 400, no mutation
    else Valid request
        API->>S: decide_join_request(actor from session)
        S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party then matching JoinRequest
        DB-->>S: Locked rows or not found
        S->>S: Check Host, request belongs to Party, Pending, Party state
        alt Missing / forbidden / already decided / cancelled / started
            S->>DB: ROLLBACK, release locks
            S-->>API: PartyError 404 / 403 / 409
            API-->>UI: Error, re-enable clicked button
        else Decision allowed
            alt Approve and active count >= capacity
                S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                S-->>API: PARTY_FULL 409
                API-->>UI: Error, no membership added
            else Reject or Approve with capacity
                opt Approve only
                    S->>DB: get_or_create membership, reactivate left_at if needed
                end
                S->>DB: Save Approved/Rejected + decided_at/by
                alt Any write fails
                    S->>DB: ROLLBACK all writes
                    Note over API,DB: Server failure, never report success or retain partial membership
                else Writes succeed
                    S->>DB: COMMIT, release locks
                    S-->>API: Decided request
                    API-->>UI: 200 request id/status
                    UI->>UI: Reload Detail and Pending list
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over S,DB: Competing decisions wait for Party lock and recheck count/state after acquisition
    Note over UI,S: Sprint 2 target: disable both buttons and refresh US6 member list once implemented
